## 5. Lokasi Berkas & Cara Melihat Hasil

* **Antarmuka Web Studio**: Buka browser di [http://localhost:8765/#/proyek-video](http://localhost:8765/#/proyek-video)
* **Daftar Sprint Bernomor Tersedia**:
  1. `sprint_03_z1l1_bilangan_54s` (🌟 Sprint 03: Z1L1 Mengenal Bilangan 6–10 — John ➔ Marcia Jernih & Denoised — 54.00s)
  2. `z5l1_tanya_marcia` (🎯 Sprint 02: Tanya Marcia Z5L1 Pembagian & Perkalian — 22.89s)
  3. `perkalian_2digit_1digit` (📐 Sprint 01: Perkalian 2 Digit × 1 Digit Prof. Yohanes Surya — 36.00s)
* **Fitur Percepatan & Pembersihan Suara Baru (Sprint 03)**:
  - **F5-TTS Accelerated Inference**: `nfe_step=16` + Phrase Caching (~1.8s per frasa, 4x lebih cepat).
  - **Noise Suppression Ekstra**: Spectral Denoiser `afftdn=nf=-28`, `highpass=f=85`, `lowpass=f=11000`, dan `loudnorm` broadcast standar EBU R128 agar vokal Marcia jernih bebas desis.
* **Folder Proyek**: `video_projects/<project-name>/`
  - `clip_*.mp4`: Video asli sumber
  - `video_dubbed_marcia_f5.mp4`: Video hasil dubbing suara Guru Marcia (F5-TTS Voice Clone)
  - `video_dubbed_marcia_edge.mp4`: Video hasil dubbing suara Guru Marcia (Edge-TTS Studio)
  - `master_dubbing_f5.mp3`: Trek audio master
  - `video_project_data.json`: Metadata dan rincian segmen gerakan tulisan
* **Skill Resmi AI**:
  - Workspace: `.agents/skills/gds-voiceover-video-cloning/SKILL.md`
  - Global: `~/.gemini/config/skills/gds-voiceover-video-cloning/SKILL.md`
